OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with terrorism
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with terrorism
OL,7,Foffences after being arrested in
OL,8,FBirmingham.
OL,10,FAyoub Essakhi, 21, from Yardley, was
OL,11,Fcharged with preparing for acts of
OL,12,Fterrorism and distribution of terrorist
OL,13,Fmaterial.
OL,15,FHe was arrested by officers from
OL,16,FCounter Terrorism Policing West
OL,17,FMidlands on 8 October.
OL,19,FEssakhi was due to appear at
OL,20,FWestminster Magistrates' Court on
OL,21,FThursday, the force said.
